---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Blog - Prithvi Jayakumar" active="blog">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-body">
      <h1>Things I’m learning, reading, and thinking about.</h1>
      <p class="intro-copy serif">
        The goal is not random updates, but useful notes from building, studying, and connecting ideas.
      </p>
      <div class="notes-grid">
        <article class="note">
          <h3>AI systems</h3>
          <p>How agents, RAG, prompts, tools, and evaluation work in real applications.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="note">
          <h3>Product ideas</h3>
          <p>Small software ideas around research, productivity, hiring, and workflow design.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="note">
          <h3>Research notes</h3>
          <p>Paper summaries, experiments, and notes from reinforcement learning and LLM work.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="note">
          <h3>Books and papers</h3>
          <p>Notes from Zero to One, Naval, Paul Graham essays, and useful technical papers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="note">
          <h3>Build logs</h3>
          <p>What I learned while building extraction tools, dashboards, and automation systems.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
